silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_08_mittens_storage_packet_sections_02_packet_anatomy_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The PacketAnatomySourceNode is Packet content (typed bytes — VetRecord_Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
